Acceleration 5 (have 4) — this one is not yours to ride yet.\n1 of 4 are inside this horse's reach today. The rotation is drawn from the whole table, not from what you have unlocked, so an early week can show you a board you cannot enter — ride the ones you can and the tiers still fill.\nThese are the same four events the 📅 Weekly and 📅 Week! tabs list. Weekly ranks on your best time whether or not it was gold and pays a placing band; Week! is the gold-only board above, with the prize ladder. This tab is the short version of both.\n🎽 Judged class of the week · Cottonwood Preliminary Test\nranked by score\nEvery dressage test and every showmanship class sits outside the four featured events, so a judged rider had no weekly loop at all. This is theirs: one class a week, ranked by mark rather than by the clock, on the same gold-ribbon rule.\n👑\nWillowbrook\n87%\n🥈\nHollypark\n84%\n🥉\nThistledown\n79%\nTake a 🥇 gold (95%) in it and you are on the board.\nRide it What it pays\n🎀 Ribbons won · 8\n8 this week\nThe pips on an event card are that event's best round and they stop at four. This is every ribbon you have ever been handed, and it never stops — ride the same course again and it still counts.\n🔒 25🎀 → 400🪙 20🎟️\n🔒 75🎀 → 4💎 1🗝️ 40🎟️\n🔒 150🎀 → 8💎 2🗝️ Epic tack 80🎟️\n🔒 300🎀 → 14💎 3🗝️ Legendary tack 140🎟️\n🏆 The road to the Basin Championship\n0/4 venues\n▫️ Cottonwood\n▫️ Barleyfold\n▫️ Coyote\n▫️ Hollowpeak\n🎫 Cottonwood is the next venue to sign off — ride Cottonwood Welcome Jump\nYour last round: Pasture Pony Dash — 23.4s. Open the result card"
